flowchart TD
  A[Change needed] --> B{Can it be additive?}
  B -->|yes| C[Ship it, with no new version]
  B -->|no| D[New version alongside the old one]
  D --> E[Announce: docs, changelog,<br/>Deprecation and Sunset headers]
  E --> F[Measure who still calls it]
  F --> G[Contact the remaining clients]
  G --> H[Brownouts: planned<br/>short outages of the old version]
  H --> I{Traffic near zero?}
  I -->|no| G
  I -->|yes| J[After the Sunset date,<br/>return 410 Gone]
